ppy, shape-shifting teen to prove his innocence.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":877269,\"title\":\"Strange World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a9x70QUXs6uEwtin1SGNKoFXoia.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5wDBVictj4wUYZ31gR5WzCM9dLD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A journey deep into an uncharted and treacherous land, where fantastical creatures await the legendary Clades—a family of explorers whose differences threaten to topple their latest, and by far most crucial, mission.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20856,\"title\":\"Aliens in the Attic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bb8ym5zSRGmhNx3gyDnzSN2waS4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7VQd0zu1YUYY3NaGbMVHEnbDWr9.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of kids must protect their vacation home from invading aliens.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6589,\"title\":\"Underdog\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pqGahPUmqrXbkeTQg7HCUa4VeHV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1BEuoA7UpCF51WpiIZ7rypAhxfs.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A lab accident gives a beagle named Shoeshine some serious superpowers -- a secret that the dog eventually shares with the young boy who becomes his owner and friend.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":601796,\"title\":\"Alienoid\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8QVDXDiOGHRcAD4oM6MXjE0osSj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZP8HtgOIDaBs12krXgUIygqEsy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Gurus in the late Goryeo dynasty try to obtain a fabled, holy sword, and humans in 2022 hunt down an alien prisoner that is locked in a